<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Nuevo mensaje de contacto - T-CERT</title>
    <style>
      body {
        background: #f4f6fa;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
        color: #222;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .container {
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 24px #0002;
        max-width: 520px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        padding: 40px 32px 32px 32px;
        border-top: 8px solid #7c3aed;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
      }
      .header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .logo {
        width: 48px;
        height: 48px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
      }
      .brand {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #7c3aed;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }
      h2 {
        color: #22223b;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .info-table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .info-table th {
        text-align: left;
        color: #7c3aed;
        font-size: 0.98rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        padding: 8px 0 2px 0;
      }
      .info-table td {
        color: #22223b;
        font-size: 1rem;
        padding-bottom: 10px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f1f1;
      }
      .info-table tr:last-child td {
        border-bottom: none;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 32px;
        font-size: 0.93rem;
        color: #888;
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 1px solid #ececec;
        padding-top: 18px;
      }
      .footer strong {
        color: #7c3aed;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="logo">
          <img
            src="https://t-cert.us/logo/only-logo/md-full-color.png"
            alt="T-CERT Logo"
            width="36"
            height="36"
          />
        </div>
        <span class="brand">T-CERT</span>
      </div>
      <h2>Nuevo mensaje de contacto recibido</h2>
      <table class="info-table" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
        <tr>
          <th
            style="
              width: 120px;
              text-align: right;
              padding-right: 18px;
              vertical-align: top;
            "
          >
            Nombre
          </th>
          <td style="text-align: left; padding-bottom: 10px; color: #22223b">
            <%= name %>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th
            style="
              width: 120px;
              text-align: right;
              padding-right: 18px;
              vertical-align: top;
            "
          >
            Empresa
          </th>
          <td style="text-align: left; padding-bottom: 10px; color: #22223b">
            <%= company %>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th
            style="
              width: 120px;
              text-align: right;
              padding-right: 18px;
              vertical-align: top;
            "
          >
            Correo
          </th>
          <td style="text-align: left; padding-bottom: 10px; color: #22223b">
            <%= email %>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th
            style="
              width: 120px;
              text-align: right;
              padding-right: 18px;
              vertical-align: top;
            "
          >
            Teléfono
          </th>
          <td style="text-align: left; padding-bottom: 10px; color: #22223b">
            <%= phone %>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th
            style="
              width: 120px;
              text-align: right;
              padding-right: 18px;
              vertical-align: top;
            "
          >
            Detalles
          </th>
          <td style="text-align: left; padding-bottom: 10px; color: #22223b">
            <%= details %>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
      <div class="footer">
        Este mensaje fue enviado desde el formulario de contacto de
        <strong>T-CERT</strong>.<br />
        Somos un ente certificador internacional.<br />
        <a
          href="https://t-cert.us"
          style="color: #7c3aed; text-decoration: none"
          >t-cert.us</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
